      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f36b82c9ec59c0d1272ffe2|full_name}: unfortunately, with skinned mesh renderers the transformation into world space occurs in the skinning compute shader, and at rendering time the object to world matrix is the same regardless of object scale (your approach does work with non-skinned Mesh Renderers)",
