      "value": "@{5c1475afb7ce126e9e0e3a39|full_name}: Ah, my bad, what's actually going on is that the normals and tangents are being scaled, but they aren't uniform so it's not something that you can use to check for specific scales. This behaviour does at least let you have normal-aligned offsets which stay proportional to your scale.",
